{{Quote|Good luck, Luke! See you at the rendezvous.|[[Wedge Antilles]] addresses Luke Skywalker shortly before evacuating Hoth|<ref name="Episode 5">{{Film|V}}</ref>}}
A '''rendezvous point''' was utilized by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]]. The rendezvous was between the [[Vosch Cluster]] and the trade worlds located around [[Caldra Tertius]] and [[Caldra Prime]].<ref name="Episode 5" /> Following the [[Battle of Hoth]],<ref name="FACPOV" /> the [[Seventh Division]]<ref name="SW 8">[[Star Wars (2020) 8|''Star Wars'' (2020) 8]]</ref> of the [[Rebel Alliance Navy]] retreated to the rendezvous.<ref name="FACPOV" /> [[Commander]] [[Luke Skywalker]]<ref name="Episode 5" /> and [[General]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] were supposed to meet up with the rebels at the rendezvous point,<ref name="FACPOV" /> but they instead joined up with the [[Fourth Division]] at [[Rendezvous Point Delta-Three]].<ref name="Star Wars 1">[[Star Wars (2020) 1|''Star Wars'' (2020) 1]]</ref>

